# OpenStreetMap Ingestion, Pathfinding, and Visualization with Meridian

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:meridian, path: "/home/mafinar/repos/elixir/meridian"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.14"},
  {:kino_maplibre, "~> 0.1"},
  {:jason, "~> 1.4"},
